          <span><span class="k">🎓</span><span class="v"><span data-lang="en">Software Engineering · PUC-Campinas</span><span data-lang="pt" hidden>Engenharia de Software · PUC-Campinas</span></span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="open">
        <div class="badge"><span data-lang="en">OSCP full-time student</span><span data-lang="pt" hidden>estudante OSCP em tempo integral</span></div>
        <div class="ctas">
          <a class="primary" href="mailto:gm.manoel.albino@proton.me">✉ <span data-lang="en">contact</span><span data-lang="pt" hidden>contato</span></a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/manoel-albino-coelho-de-miranda-neto-6074b6237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/whisperx00" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github</a>
